WEBVTT

00:11:27.386 --> 00:11:30.566
and all it really took was
five minutes once a week,

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:33.173
(Music)

00:11:34.563 --> 00:11:37.395
AG: It was a step toward
a less lonely work environment.

00:11:37.805 --> 00:11:40.116
What's your version of inside scoop?

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:41.512
If you're in a tech company,

00:11:41.536 --> 00:11:44.726
it might be holding an annual
"Bring your Parents to Work" day.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:47.614
If you're a manager, it might be
telling your direct reports

00:11:47.638 --> 00:11:49.266
about your closest friend.

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:50.750
If you're working remotely,

00:11:50.774 --> 00:11:54.430
it might be giving your colleagues
a virtual tour of your home office.

00:11:55.413 --> 00:11:57.174
The US isn't the only country

00:11:57.198 --> 00:11:59.856
where government officials
are worried about loneliness.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:03.016
There's one country that's taken
a much bigger step.